    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The land knows whose teeth marks live here.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Apex Den.</strong> You can spend 10 minutes claiming a 30-foot-radius area as your den. Until you take a Soma Break or claim a new den, while you are within that area:</p>\n<ul><li>You have reroll the lowest die on initiative rolls [TODO(adv-call)].</li><li>The first time you hit a creature in your den each round, the attack deals an additional 1d6 damage of the weapon’s type.</li><li>You always know if any Medium or larger creature crosses the boundary while you are inside.</li></ul>\n<p>You can have only one den at a time.</p>",
